{"id":"2e3e5877d95b23f0","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-composite-fibration.md","title":"纤维化的复合","display":"thm-composite-fibration — 纤维化的复合","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-composite-fibration","aliases":["16-thm-composite-fibration","Composite fibration","16-composite-fibration"],"display":"thm-composite-fibration — 纤维化的复合","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","[[16-df-fibre]]"],"source":"Lemma1.5.5(i) pp.61–62 (PDF81–82); object-fibre bijection expanded locally","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-composite-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-composite-fibration</span><span>Composite fibration</span><span>16-composite-fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-composite-fibration — 纤维化的复合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma1.5.5(i) pp.61–62 (PDF81–82); object-fibre bijection expanded locally"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 均为纤维化，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D^{pq}_I\">\\(\\mathcal D^{pq}_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D^q_X\">\\(\\mathcal D^q_X\\)</span> 分别是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a> 对复合投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\circ q\">\\(p\\circ q\\)</span> 与投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 构造的纤维，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\coprod\">\\(\\coprod\\)</span> 使用带标签的不交并。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}(p\\circ q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fib}(p\\circ q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D^{pq}_I)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\coprod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I}\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D^q_X),\n\\qquad Y\\longmapsto(qY,Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D^{pq}_I)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\coprod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I}\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D^q_X),\n\\qquad Y\\longmapsto(qY,Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(Y\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to pqY\">\\(u:I\\to pqY\\)</span>，先取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-笛卡尔 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:X\\to qY\">\\(a:X\\to qY\\)</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 上，再取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>-笛卡尔 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:Y&#39;\\to Y\">\\(b:Y&#39;\\to Y\\)</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 上。对任意待分解箭头，先用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 唯一分解其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 像，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 唯一提升，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pq\">\\(pq\\)</span> 的笛卡尔泛性质。</li>\n<li>对象分解是带标记不交并与对象集合的规范双射，不是不同集合编码的字面相等；这里也未声称复合纤维是各内层纤维的范畴余积。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Lemma1.5.5(i) pp.61–62（PDF81–82）；对象纤维双射由定义直接展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibre]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$、$q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E$ 均为纤维化，见 [[16-df-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$；$\\mathcal D^{pq}_I$、$\\mathcal D^q_X$ 分别是 [[16-df-fibre]] 对复合投影 $p\\circ q$ 与投影 $q$ 构造的纤维，$\\coprod$ 使用带标签的不交并。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D^{pq}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D^q_X","display":false},{"tex":"p\\circ q","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\coprod","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib}(p\\circ q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D^{pq}_I)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\coprod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I}\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D^q_X),\n\\qquad Y\\longmapsto(qY,Y).","display":true},{"tex":"Y\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to pqY","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"a:X\\to qY","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"b:Y'\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"pq","display":false}],"bytes":1740,"backlinks":[{"id":"4db97b7c5bd611b9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"若 q-笛卡尔 f 的 q 像又是 p-笛卡尔，先按 p 分解再按 q 分解即给 r-笛卡尔性。反向先以 p-笛卡尔及 q-笛卡尔的连续提升构造同一基箭头、同一靶的标准 r-提升；任意 r-笛卡尔 f 与它相差一个 r-垂直同构。q 及 p 都保持同构，因此 f 本身 q-笛卡尔且 qf 为 p-笛卡尔。于是任意两条可复合纤维化均满足本页谓词，复合存在见 [[16-thm-composite-fibration]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-406","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-composite-fibration|thm-composite-fibration — 纤维化的复合]]"},{"id":"48c8cf2e43833ed2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 与函子复合采用 [[16-thm-composite-fibration]] 已核对的定义和参数。"}],"outgoing":["c9801f31ec8ac53f","427be4d627513590","aa1ce0bab1ae8910"]}